# UI case studies

When building or updating **Settings, Profile, Auth, Empty state, or Dashboard** screens, load `ui-case-studies` and the matching `cases/*.md` file. Follow its default sections and content expectations; remove what YAGNI. Still run mockup-first + `hallmark` for visuals.
